b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-790f876ad292793303fb","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-c41c0565cf67aa38c9ac","layer":"original","quote":"权立表下漏以待之〖13〗。及〔日〕中不至，权问其故，范曰：“时尚未正中也。”顷之，有风动帷。范拊手曰：“羽至矣！”须臾，外称“万岁〖14〗”，传言得羽","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":122,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-37844cc033f6c2f91e32","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，璋司马马忠，获羽及其子平、都督赵累等于章乡〖22〗，遂定荆州。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o092b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-4d7403165ca63fd7da46","layer":"original","quote":"权使朱然、潘璋，断其径路；即父子俱获，荆州遂定。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o092","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-4d7403165ca63fd7da46","layer":"original","quote":"会权寻至，羽自知孤穷，乃走麦城〖26〗；西至漳乡〖27〗，众皆委羽而降。权使朱然、潘璋，断其径路；即父子俱获，荆州遂定。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
